# About

Import Layout.

## Page /about

Head:
    <title>About — Acme</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Three people, one workshop, since 2019.">

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p id="body">Three people and one workshop, since 2019.</p>
    {end}

## Test: the about page says who Acme is and marks About active

Expect that the text of "h1" is equal to "About".
Expect that the text of "#body" is equal to "Three people and one workshop, since 2019.".
Expect that the count of "nav a" is equal to 4.
Expect that the count of "nav a.active" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "nav a.active" is equal to "About".
